' F19 -- Results: retrieval quality on the real corpus.
' HERO FIGURE (Chapter 6, Evaluation).
' Claim supported: retrieval quality against 50 hand-written questions over six real
' lectures, at the production defaults (k=5 lecture / k=6 course, threshold 0.65).
' Three scorecard metrics were not measured (see F18: the harness cannot run against
' the live system), and are shown as such rather than invented.
' Data: thesis/results/20260917T214528Z/grid_results.{md,csv} (run 2026-09-17 at
' a696be1-dirty, 170 commits after 0be0081). The course-scoped search changed on
' 2026-10-14 (b66a97c6, migration 20261014000000_match_slides_scoped_by_pdf_hash.sql),
' so the course row predates the pinned revision dfc20df6 and should be re-run there.
' Defaults: backend/services/ai/retrieval.py:30-32.
@startuml f19-results
!include _style.iuml

title Results — retrieval on the real corpus

skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 10
}

rectangle SCORE #FFFFFF [
<b>Retrieval, threshold 0.65 (production defaults)</b>
|= Metric |= Lecture tutor, k=5 |= Course tutor, k=6 |
| Questions run | 50 of 50 | 27 of 50 (23 skipped) |
| Slide found in top k | 0.920 | 0.963 |
| Anchor text found | 0.940 | 1.000 |
| MRR | 0.786 | 0.858 |
| Precision@k (ceiling) | 0.184 (0.200) | 0.160 (0.167) |
| Refusal / false refusal | 0.020 / 0.000 | 0.000 / 0.000 |
]

rectangle NOT #DCDCDC [
<b>Not measured</b>
quiz key accuracy · tutor faithfulness · synthesis quality
the scorecard harness cannot run against the live system
]

rectangle META #F2F2F2 [
<b>Run</b> 2026-09-17, commit a696be1 with uncommitted changes
<b>Golden set</b> 50 questions, 6 real lectures, anchors verified
<b>Caveat</b> course search changed on 2026-10-14 (b66a97c6);
the course column predates the pinned revision
]

SCORE -[hidden]down- NOT
NOT -[hidden]down- META

legend bottom
  Skipped: 23 questions whose lecture has no course, so the course tutor cannot reach them.
  Precision@k is capped by one relevant slide per question; the ceiling is 1/k.
endlegend

@enduml
